业","- economy 经济 · economic 经济的 · economical 省钱的（三个别混）","- revenue 收入 · expense 支出 · profit 利润 · budget 预算","- investment 投资 · capital 资本 · asset 资产 · debt 债务","- inflation 通胀 · recession 衰退 · recovery 复苏","- consumer 消费者 · retail 零售 · wholesale 批发","- negotiate 谈判 · contract 合同 · bid 投标","- subsidy 补贴 · tariff 关税 · quota 配额","- boost 提振 · decline 下滑 · fluctuate 波动","","## 四、科技环保","- innovation 创新 · breakthrough 突破 · patent 专利","- artificial intelligence 人工智能 · algorithm 算法 · automation 自动化","- digital 数字的 · virtual 虚拟的 · wireless 无线的","- emission 排放 · carbon 碳 · renewable 可再生的","- pollution 污染 · recycle 回收 · sustainable 可持续的","- ecosystem 生态系统 · biodiversity 生物多样性","- energy consumption 能源消耗 · efficiency 能效","- conservation 保护 · awareness 意识","","## 五、社会文化","- tradition 传统 · custom 习俗 · heritage 遗产","- urban 城市的 · rural 农村的 · suburb 郊区","- population 人口 · ageing population 老龄化","- welfare 福利 · charity 慈善 · volunteer 志愿者","- inequality 不平等 · discrimination 歧视 · diversity 多样性","- generation gap 代沟 · peer pressure 同辈压力","- community 社区 · public service 公共服务","- civilized 文明的 · courtesy 礼貌","","## 六、怎么用这份词表（每天 20 分钟）","1. 只记「词 + 一个搭配」，不背孤立单词（acquire knowledge 比 acquire 好记）。","2. 当天记的词，晚上听真题音频时留意：听到就画个勾，第二天先复习画勾的。","3. 写作/翻译时主动换词：想说 think 就换 hold the view that，想说 important 就换 significant。","4. 一次记 20 个，隔天复习 + 再记 20 个；记不住的单独抄一行，周末只看那一行。"].join("\n")},{client_id:"mat_cet6_writing",title:"六级·写作模板库（骨架 / 万能句 / 过渡词 / 替换）",chapter:"写作",content:["## 一、三段式骨架（背这一张就够）","- 首段（2 句）：第 1 句改写题目（把题目换个说法说一遍）；第 2 句给立场（I believe / In my view）。","- 中段（4 句）：两个理由，每个理由后面跟一句具体例子（Take … for example）。","- 尾段（1 句）：重申立场（Therefore / In short + 换个说法重说观点）。","全程 150-180 词。句数写死，考场上只填内容。","","## 二、万能句 10 条（换词不换结构）","1. There is no denying that … （不可否认……）","2. It is widely accepted that … （人们普遍认为……）","3. Take … for example / For instance, … （以……为例）","4. Although … , … （虽然……但是……）","5. Not only … but also … （不仅……而且……；写不对就拆成两句）","6. The reason why … is that … （……的原因在于）","7. Compared with … , … （与……相比）","8. It is high time that we took action to … （该行动了）","9. What matters most is that … （最重要的是）","10. Only in this way can we … （只有这样我们才能；注意倒装）","","## 三、过渡词 15 个（别只用一个）","- 顺承：besides / moreover / in addition / what is more","- 转折：however / nevertheless / on the contrary / instead","- 因果：therefore / thus / as a result / consequently","- 举例：for example / for instance / take … as an example","- 总结：in short / to sum up / in conclusion","","## 四、常用替换（把小学词换成得分词）","- important → significant / crucial","- think → believe / hold the view that","- many → numerous / a considerable number of","- good at → be proficient in","- get → obtain / acquire","- help → contribute to / be conducive to","","## 五、考场 30 分钟怎么用","1. 0-3 分钟：读题 + 在草稿纸写三段提纲（每段写关键词，不写整句）。","2. 3-23 分钟：写正文。首段与尾段优先写，中段例子想不出就写「身边的事」。","3. 23-28 分钟：只查三件事 —— 主谓一致、时态统一、拼写与单复数。","4. 28-30 分钟：通读一遍，把明显写错的句子改简单（宁可短句，不要错句）。"].join("\n")},{client_id:"mat_cet6_translation",title:"六级·翻译高频词组（文化 / 教育 / 经济 / 社会）",chapter:"翻译",content:["## 一、中国文化","- 有着悠久历史 has a long history","- 传统文化 traditional culture","- 象征 symbolize / be a symbol of","- 春节 the Spring Festival · 中秋节 the Mid-Autumn Festival","- 剪纸 paper cutting · 书法 calligraphy · 京剧 Peking Opera","- 团圆 family reunion · 拜年 pay New Year calls","- 传统美德 traditional virtue · 代代相传 pass down from generation to generation","- 越来越受欢迎 become increasingly popular","","## 二、教育","- 素质教育 quality-oriented education","- 义务教育 compulsory education","- 录取 be admitted to · 毕业 graduate from","- 培养兴趣 cultivate an interest in","- 终身学习 lifelong learning","- 提高教学质量 improve the quality of teaching","- 学生数量 the number of students（谓语用单数）","- 重视 attach importance to","","## 三、经济与科技","- 高速发展 develop rapidly / rapid development","- 国民经济 national economy","- 生活水平 living standard · 稳步提升 improve steadily","- 互联网技术 Internet technology · 5G 网络 the 5G network","- 移动支付 mobile payment · 电子商务 e-commerce","- 创新 drive innovation · 应用广泛 be widely used","- 为……提供便利 provide convenience for …","- 发挥重要作用 play an important role in","","## 四、社会与环保","- 环境保护 environmental protection","- 减少污染 reduce pollution","- 节约资源 save resources","- 可持续发展 sustainable development","- 公众意识 public awareness","- 政府采取措施 the government takes measures to …","- 人口老龄化 population ageing","- 改善生活质量 improve the quality of life","","## 五、万能句型 6 条（不会写长句就用它们）","1. China is a country with … （中国是一个有着……的国家）","2. With the development of … , … （随着……的发展）","3. It is important for us to … （对我们来说……很重要）","4. More and more people … （越来越多的人……）","5. China has made great progress in … （中国在……方面取得了巨大进步）","6. This not only … but also … （就写 not only 那句；写不对就拆两句）","","## 六、写完只查三件事","1. 主谓一致（第三人称单数别漏 s）。","2. 时态统一 —— 拿不准就全用一般现在时。","3. 单复数与拼写。这三条能捞回 10 分以上。"].join("\n")},{client_id:"mat_cet6_listening",title:"六级·听力场景词（校园 / 职场 / 交通 / 医疗 / 购物）",chapter:"听力",content:["## 一、校园","- lecture 讲座 · seminar 研讨课 · tutorial 辅导课","- assignment 作业 · essay 论文 · deadline 截止期","- library 图书馆 · renew 续借 · overdue 逾期","- professor 教授 · tutor 导师 · classmate 同学","- exam 考试 · grade 成绩 · credit 学分","- dormitory 宿舍 · canteen 食堂 · campus 校园","- scholarship 奖学金 · tuition 学费 · semester 学期","- register 注册 · course 课程 · schedule 课表","","## 二、职场","- interview 面试 · applicant 应聘者 · position 职位","- salary 薪水 · benefit 福利 · promotion 晋升","- meeting 会议 · agenda 议程 · deadline 截止期","- colleague 同事 · manager 经理 · client 客户","- overtime 加班 · shift 轮班 · vacation 假期","- resign 辞职 · recruit 招聘 · contract 合同","- report 报告 · project 项目 · budget 预算","- colleague 同事 · department 部门 · branch 分公司","","## 三、交通出行","- flight 航班 · delay 延误 · cancel 取消","- boarding pass 登机牌 · luggage 行李 · check in 办理登记","- platform 站台 · departure 出发 · arrival 到达","- traffic jam 堵车 · rush hour 高峰时段","- fare 车费 · ticket 车票 · refund 退款","- book a room 订房 · reservation 预订 · vacancy 空房","- deposit 押金 · check out 退房 · service 服务","- direction 方向 · map 地图 · shortcut 近路","","## 四、健康医疗","- symptom 症状 · prescription 处方 · pharmacy 药房","- appointment 预约 · clinic 诊所 · ward 病房","- diet 饮食 · nutrition 营养 · obesity 肥胖","- exercise 锻炼 · stress 压力 · insomnia 失眠","- treatment 治疗 · recover 康复 · allergy 过敏","- insurance 保险 · fee 费用 · emergency 急诊","- checkup 体检 · blood pressure 血压","- habit 习惯 · balanced 均衡的","","## 五、天气与购物","- forecast 预报 · shower 阵雨 · humid 潮湿的","- temperature 气温 · breeze 微风 · thunderstorm 雷雨","- discount 折扣 · refund 退款 · receipt 收据","- try on 试穿 · size 尺码 · exchange 换货","- brand 品牌 · price tag 价签 · cashier 收银台","- out of stock 缺货 · on sale 打折 · warranty 保修","","## 六、讲座与新闻常见框架词","- today we will focus on … （今天讲……）","- first of all / secondly / finally （分层提示，考点常在「其次」后）","- on the contrary 相反 · in contrast 相比之下","- for example / to illustrate 举例（例子本身不考，结论才考）","- therefore 因此 · as a result 结果是（结论句是考点）","- to sum up 总结（结尾常考）","","## 七、怎么用这份表","1. 每天挑一个场景，把词读三遍（会读才可能听懂）。","2. 做真题听力时，听到场景词就在旁边画勾 —— 画勾密度就是你的听力安全感来源。","3. 错题对照：如果整段没听懂，先查是不是场景词不认识。"].join("\n")},{client_id:"mat_cet6_reading",title:"六级·阅读同义替换表（找不着原词就看它）",chapter:"阅读",content:["## 一、为什么同义替换决定分数","正确选项几乎不会照抄原文，而是把原文换个说法。找不到「原词」就慌，是阅读丢分的主要原因。","做错题时，请把「题干词 → 原文词」这条替换写在旁边，比抄答案有用十倍。","","## 二、常见替换（动词）","- increase → rise / grow / go up / soar","- decrease → decline / drop / fall / reduce","- cause → lead to / result in / give rise to","- solve → tackle / address / deal with","- improve → enhance / boost / upgrade","- support → back / favor / be in favor of","- oppose → object to / be against","- ignore → overlook / neglect / turn a blind eye to","- allow → permit / enable / make it possible","- need → require / call for / demand","","## 三、常见替换（名词与形容词）","- important → significant / crucial / vital / essential","- difficult → tough / challenging / demanding","- many → numerous / a large number of / a host of","- few → scarce / rare / limited","- advantage → benefit / strength / merit","- disadvantage → drawback / downside / weakness","- reason → cause / factor / explanation","- result → outcome / consequence / finding","- problem → issue / challenge / obstacle","- idea → notion / concept / view","","## 四、题干与原文的连接词","- because → due to / owing to / as a result of","- although → despite / in spite of / while","- if → provided that / as long as / on condition that","- so that → in order to / so as to","- about → regarding / concerning / with respect to","- according to → based on / in light of","","## 五、选项里的三个陷阱","1. 出现原文原词：多半是干扰项（正确项常做改写）。","2. 出现绝对词：must / never / all / only / completely —— 先怀疑。","3. 出现「常识正确」但与原文无关的内容：答案必须能在原文找到依据。","","## 六、段落匹配的两步走","1. 题干里圈一个「不会变形」的词：数字、大写专有名词、斜体词。","2. 逐段只读首句与末句（段落主旨常在这两句），配上一个划掉一个；剩下的用排除法。"].join("\n")},{client_id:"mat_cet6_flow",title:"六级·考场时间分配与流程（照着做就行）",chapter:"考场",content:["## 一、整卷顺序与时间（四级六级通用）","1. 写作 30 分钟（不能提前做听力，写作结束才发听力卷）。","2. 听力 25 分钟（放音结束立刻收答题卡，没有回头补涂的时间）。","3. 阅读 40 分钟：选词填空 5 分钟 → 段落匹配 10 分钟 → 仔细阅读 25 分钟。","4. 翻译 30 分钟。","自己模考必须严格计时，顺序不要改 —— 换个顺序做，正确率与心态都会变。","","## 二、听力最重要的两条纪律","1. 答题卡边听边涂（听力结束就收卡，来不及补）。","2. 一句没听懂就放下，跟着音频走；停下来回想，后面三句全丢。","","## 三、阅读的取舍（投入产出比排序）","- 仔细阅读每题 14 分 → 优先，25 分钟给两篇。","- 段落匹配每题约 7 分 → 其次，10 分钟。","- 选词填空每题约 3.5 分、全国正确率不到 30% → 限时 5 分钟；做不完全选同一项（别留空）。","","## 四、翻译与写作的共同纪律","1. 空着一句就是零分 —— 不会的句子用简单句写出来，写完就有分。","2. 宁写短句不写错句：一句一主一谓。","3. 收尾留 2-4 分钟只查三件事：主谓一致、时态统一、拼写与单复数。","","## 五、考前一周做什么","1. 每两天一套完整真题（严格计时，含涂卡）。","2. 只复盘错题的三样东西：定位词、同义替换、错因归类（词不认识 / 定位错 / 想多了）。","3. 背熟写作三段骨架与 10 条万能句；翻译只背高频词组，不再学新语法。","","## 六、考前一夜与当天","- 考前一夜：不刷新题，只过一遍作文模板与高频词表，正常时间睡觉。","- 当天：带齐准考证、身份证、2B 铅笔、黑色签字笔（备一支）、橡皮；听力耳机提前试音。","- 心态：六级不是选拔考试，题型固定、套路固定，按流程做完就是正常发挥。"].join("\n")}],Ka=["#18181B","#10B981","#F59E0B","#EF4444","#3F3F46","#EC4899","#06B6D4","#84CC16","#F97316","#14B8A6","#3B82F6","#22C55E","#EAB308","#DC2626","#52525B"],Ha=[{id:"life",name:"生活",color:"#10B981",kind:"system"},{id:"work",name:"工作",color:"#3B82F6",kind:"system"},{id:"mood",name:"心情",color:"#EC4899",kind:"system"},{id:"study",name:"学习",color:"#F59E0B",kind:"system"},{id:"social",name:"社交",color:"#06B6D4",kind:"system"},{id:"other",name:"其他",color:"#71717A",kind:"system"}];function Ja(){const e=function(){const e=uni.getStorageSync("siji_tag_categories");if(!e)return[];try{return JSON.parse(e)}catch{return[]}}();return[...Ha,...e]}function Wa(e){const t=`siji_tags_${e}`,n=uni.getStorageSync(t);if(!n)return[];try{return JSON.parse(n)}catch{return[]}}function Ga(e,t){d(`siji_tags_${e}`,t)}function Xa(e){const t={};if("diary"===e){(uni.getStorageInfoSync().keys||[]).filter((e=>e.startsWith("diary_"))).forEach((e=>{Fn(e).forEach((e=>{if(1===e.is_deleted)return;(Array.isArray(e.tags)?e.tags:[]).forEach((e=>{if(e&&e.trim()){const n=e.trim();t[n]=(t[n]||0)+1}}))}))}))}else if("plan"===e){Fn("plan_all").forEach((e=>{if(1===e.is_deleted)return;(Array.isArray(e.tags)?e.tags:[]).forEach((e=>{if(e&&e.trim()){const n=e.trim();t[n]=(t[n]||0)+1}}))}))}const n=Wa(e),a={};n.forEach((e=>{a[e.name]=e}));const l=new Set(n.map((e=>e.color)).filter(Boolean));let o=0;return[...new Set([...Object.keys(t),...Object.keys(a)])].sort(((e,n)=>(t[n]||0)-(t[e]||0))).map((e=>{const n=a[e]||{};let i=n.color;if(!i){for(;l.has(Ka[o%Ka.length])&&(o++,!(o>2*Ka.length)););i=Ka[o%Ka.length],l.add(i),o++}return{name:e,color:i,count:t[e]||0,category:n.category||"",categoryId:n.categoryId||"other"}}))}function Qa(e,t,n,a,l){const o=Wa(e),i=o.find((e=>e.name===t));if(i)return n&&(i.color=n),a&&(i.category=a),l&&(i.categoryId=l),Ga(e,o),i;const s=new Set(o.map((e=>e.color))),r=n||Ka.find((e=>!s.has(e)))||Ka[o.length%Ka.length],c={name:t,color:r,category:a||"",categoryId:l||"other"};return o.push(c),Ga(e,o),c}const Za="技巧",el="复习资料",tl="study",nl="cet6",al=["tip_cet6_writing_1","tip_cet6_writing_2","tip_cet6_writing_3","tip_cet6_reading_1","tip_cet6_reading_2","tip_cet6_reading_3","tip_cet6_listening_1","tip_cet6_listening_2","tip_cet6_listening_3","tip_cet6_translation_1","tip_cet6_translation_2","tip_cet6_translation_3"],ll=["## 一、这一章只解决一件事","把「作文」从扣分项变成稳定得分项。你现在写作+翻译合计 96 分（满分 212），扣的 116 分里，绝大多数不是不会写，而是写错——错一句减一档。","所以整章的规矩只有一句：**宁可朴素，不要出错。**","","## 二、三段式骨架（照这个结构填内容就行）","1. 首段两句：把题目改写一遍 + 给出你的立场。改写题目是白送的分数，别跳过。","2. 中段四句：两个理由，每个理由后面跟一句具体例子。理由要「大路货」，例子要具体到人/事/数字。","3. 尾段一句：重申立场。不加新观点，不写长句。","","全文控制在 150-180 词。少于 150 词按低档给分；超过 200 词，每多一句就多一次出错机会。","","## 三、只背三个句型（多了记不住，考场上也用不出来）","- 观点句：There is no denying that … （没人能否认……）","- 举例句：Take … for example, … （以……为例）","- 让步句：Although …, … （虽然……，但是……）","","三个句型循环用，结构照抄、名词动词换成本题话题的词。","","## 四、常见坑","- 全程一个时态最安全：一般现在时。想写过去的事，整段都改成过去时，别混。","- 第三人称单数、名词复数、冠词——这三样最容易漏，也最容易扣分。","- 不要为了「显得高级」写长从句。阅卷老师只看有没有错，不看你写得多花。","","## 五、今天怎么练（15 分钟）","1. 拿一套真题作文题，只写首段两句（3 分钟）。","2. 再写中段两个理由 + 两个例子（8 分钟），写完数一遍词数。","3. 留 4 分钟专查三件事：三单、时态、拼写。把查出来的错抄在下面一行，考前再看一遍。"].join("\n"),ol=["## 一、这一章只解决一件事","把听力从「试图听懂全文」改成「在选项里找答案」。你现在听力 140（满分 249），这是四块里最容易在短期内提分的一块。","","## 二、视听一致：听到什么选什么","六级听力 90% 的正确答案，在你听到的音频里都有「同样的词或同义替换」出现在选项里。","做法：读选项时把每个选项的关键词圈出来，听到哪个词就盯哪个选项，对上就选，不推理、不等听懂全文。","","拿不准的时候选「听到的词最多的那个选项」——这是平均期望最高的猜法。","","## 三、答案常在这三处","1. 开头句：新闻听力的导语往往就是第一题答案，开头没听清后面白搭。","2. 转折词后：however / but / in fact / actually 后面十有八九是考点。","3. 结尾句：讲话人收尾时爱重复观点，也是常考位置。","","听到转折词立刻打起精神——这三个位置比「听懂全文」划算得多。","","## 四、用读题时间预读选项","- 每题开始前的 5-8 秒，快速扫选项，圈名词和动词。","- 长对话重点看第二个人的回答：考点常在回应里，不在提问里。","- 讲座 / 篇章题先看选项里的专有名词，听到就定位。","","读题不是「看一眼」，是把选项之间的差异点圈出来。","","## 五、常见坑","- 一个词没听懂就停下来想，结果后面三句全丢。听不懂就跳过，跟着音频走。","- 把「同义替换」当成没听到：选项写 reduce，音频说 cut down，这也是视听一致，要选。","- 数字题听到一个数字就选：注意音频里常给两个数字，问的是后一个（或两者之差）。","","## 六、今天怎么练（15 分钟）","1. 拿一套真题听力，不查生词、不回听，只做「听到选项词就打勾」（10 分钟）。","2. 对答案，统计「我圈中的词出现在正确答案里的比例」——这个比例就是你视听一致的命中率（3 分钟）。","3. 把没选出来的题对照原文找转折词位置，记下它出现在第几句（2 分钟）。"].join("\n"),il=["## 一、这一章只解决一件事","把时间从「性价比最低的题」搬到「性价比最高的题」。你阅读 131（满分 249），真正的短板不是读不懂，而是时间分配。","","## 二、先做一次取舍：选词填空只给 5 分钟","- 选词填空 10 题，每题约 3.5 分，全国正确率不到 30%。","- 仔细阅读每题 14 分，是选词填空的 4 倍。","","做法：选词填空**限时 5 分钟**；做不完就全选同一个选项（别留空），省下的 10 分钟全部给仔细阅读。","这是整张卷子里性价比最高的一次取舍。","","## 三、仔细阅读：题干定位 + 同义替换","1. 先读题干，圈定位词：数字、大写、专有名词。","2. 回原文找**同义替换**，而不是找原词。","3. 答案通常在定位句本身，或紧接的下一句。","","两个陷阱：","- 选项里出现原文原词——多半是干扰项（正确项常做同义改写）。","- 选项里出现太绝对的词（must / never / all / only）——先怀疑它。","","## 四、段落匹配：先扫题干再配段落","1. 先把 10 个题干各圈一个关键词（不要先读全文）。","2. 逐段只扫首句和尾句，配上一个就划掉一个。","3. 剩下的用排除法收尾——段落数多于题干数，剩下的本来就是干扰。","","## 五、常见坑","- 在一道题上反复回读，超过 2 分钟就猜一个往下走。","- 靠「常识」选答案：答案必须能在原文找到依据。","- 先通读全文再做题：时间不够时这是最亏的顺序。","","## 六、今天怎么练（20 分钟）","1. 拿一套真题的仔细阅读，计时 15 分钟做完两篇（含涂卡）。","2. 对答案，把每道错题的「定位词」和「原文同义替换」写在旁边（5 分钟）。","3. 记一句话：错题不是因为读不懂，是因为没找到那句同义替换。"].join("\n"),sl=["## 一、这一章只解决一件事","让翻译从「大片空白」变成「每句都有分」。翻译和写作共用 212 分，你的 96 分里翻译丢得最多。","","## 二、简单句 + 绝不空着","- 一句一主一谓。长句拆成两句，比写错从句强得多。","- 词汇不会就替换：不会 the Spring Festival，就写 a big Chinese holiday。","","空着一句就是零分，写完就有分。宁可朴素，不要空白。","","## 三、高频话题词汇（每类记 5 个就够）","- 传统节日：traditional / festival / celebrate / custom / symbol","- 饮食文化：food / culture / taste / popular / healthy","- 教育：education / student / knowledge / skill / improve","- 经济科技：economy / develop / technology / industry / progress","","单词不必难，拼对、用对才是分。考试时先把话题词往里套，再补主语谓语。","","## 四、常考的三种句式","1. 「……是一个有着悠久历史的国家」→ China is a country with a long history.","2. 「随着……的发展，人们越来越……」→ With the development of …, people are more and more …","3. 「不仅……而且……」→ not only … but also …（写不对就拆成两句，一样得分）","","## 五、写完只查三件事","1. 主谓一致（第三人称单数别漏 s）。","2. 时态统一——拿不准就全用一般现在时。","3. 单复数与拼写。","","这三条能捞回 10 分以上，比多背一百个单词管用。","","## 六、今天怎么练（15 分钟）","1. 找一段真题翻译（3 句），按「一句一主一谓」写一遍（8 分钟）。","2. 对照参考译文，只标两件事：我漏了哪个词、哪个句子结构写错了（4 分钟）。","3. 把写错的那句重写一遍到能背下来（3 分钟）。"].join("\n"),rl=[{client_id:"tip_cet6_ch_writing",title:"六级·写作章：三段式骨架 + 只背三个句型",chapter:"写作",tag:Za,content:ll},{client_id:"tip_cet6_ch_listening",title:"六级·听力章：视听一致（听到什么选什么）",chapter:"听力",tag:Za,content:ol},{client_id:"tip_cet6_ch_reading",title:"六级·阅读章：放弃选词填空，时间给仔细阅读",chapter:"阅读",tag:Za,content:il},{client_id:"tip_cet6_ch_translation",title:"六级·翻译章：简单句 + 绝不空着",chapter:"翻译",tag:Za,content:sl},...Ya.map((e=>({client_id:e.client_id,title:e.title,chapter:e.chapter,tag:el,content:e.content})))];function cl(e){const t=new Map;return function(e){const t=new Date(e),n=new Set;for(let l=0;l<=12;l++){const e=new Date(t.getFullYear(),t.getMonth()-l,1);n.add("diary_"+Pn(e.getTime()))}try{const e="undefined"!=typeof uni&&uni.getStorageInfoSync?uni.getStorageInfoSync():null;(e&&e.keys||[]).forEach((e=>{/^diary_\d{4}-\d{2}$/.test(e)&&n.add(e)}))}catch(a){}return Array.from(n)}(e).forEach((e=>{Fn(e).forEach(((n,a)=>{n&&n.client_id&&!t.has(n.client_id)&&t.set(n.client_id,{item:n,key:e,idx:a})}))})),t}rl.map((e=>e.client_id));const ul="siji_index";function dl(){const e={diary:{},bill:{},plan:{},updatedAt:Date.now()};(uni.getStorageInfoSync().keys||[]).forEach((t=>{if(t.startsWith("diary_")){const n=t.substring(6);Fn(t).forEach((t=>{if(1===t.is_deleted)return;vl(`${t.title||""} ${t.content||""} ${t.mood||""}`).forEach((a=>{e.diary[a]||(e.diary[a]=[]),e.diary[a].push({id:t.client_id,month:n,title:t.title||"",date:t.created_at})}))}))}else if(t.startsWith("bill_")){const n=t.substring(5);Fn(t).forEach((t=>{if(1===t.is_deleted)return;vl(`${t.category||""} ${t.note||""}`).forEach((a=>{e.bill[a]||(e.bill[a]=[]),e.bill[a].push({id:t.client_id,month:n,amount:t.amount,category:t.category,date:t.bill_date})}))}))}}));return Fn("plan_all").forEach((t=>{if(1===t.is_deleted)return;vl(`${t.title||""} ${t.description||""}`).forEach((n=>{e.plan[n]||(e.plan[n]=[]),e.plan[n].push({id:t.client_id,title:t.title||"",status:t.status})}))})),d(ul,e),e}function ml(){const e=uni.getStorageSync(ul);if(!e)return dl();try{return JSON.parse(e)}catch{return dl()}}function pl(e,t){if(!t)return[];const n=ml()[e]||{},a=t.toLowerCase(),l=[];return n[a]&&l.push(...n[a]),Object.keys(n).forEach((e=>{if(e!==a&&(e.includes(a)||a.includes(e))){const t=new Set(l.map((e=>e.id)));n[e].forEach((e=>{t.has(e.id)||l.push(e)}))}})),l}function gl(e,t){if(!t||1===t.is_deleted)return;const n=ml(),a=n[e]||(n[e]={}),l=vl("diary"===e?`${t.title||""} ${t.content||""} ${t.mood||""}`:"bill"===e?`${t.category||""} ${t.note||""}`:`${t.title||""} ${t.description||""}`),o="plan"===e?null:t.bill_date?t.bill_date.substring(0,7):Pn(t.created_at);l.forEach((e=>{a[e]||(a[e]=[]);a[e].find((e=>e.id===t.client_id))||a[e].push({id:t.client_id,month:o,title:t.title||"",date:t.created_at||t.bill_date})})),n.updatedAt=Date.now(),d(ul,n)}function vl(e){if(!e)return[];const t=[],n=e.match(/[a-zA-Z0-9]+/g)||[];t.push(...n.map((e=>e.toLowerCase())));const a=e.replace(/[\s\w]/g,"").split("");for(let l=0;l<a.length-1;l++)t.push(a[l]+a[l+1]);return t.filter((e=>e.length>0))}function fl(e={}){const{sanitize:t=!0}=e,n=uni.getStorageInfoSync().keys||[],a={meta:{app:"思迹",version:"1.0.0",exportedAt:(new Date).toISOString(),deviceId:t?"***":uni.getStorageSync("siji_device_id")||""},diaries:[],bills:[],plans:[]};return n.forEach((e=>{if(e.startsWith("diary_")){const t=Fn(e);a.diaries.push(...t.filter((e=>1!==e.is_deleted)))}else if(e.startsWith("bill_")){const t=Fn(e);a.bills.push(...t.filter((e=>1!==e.is_deleted)))}})),a.plans=Fn("plan_all").filter((e=>1!==e.is_deleted)),t&&n.filter((e=>e.includes("key")||e.includes("secret")||e.includes("token")||e.includes("provider"))),a}function yl(){return JSON.stringify(fl(),null,2)}function hl(e){const t=fl();if("diary"===e){const e=["client_id","title","content","mood","tags","created_at"],n=t.diaries.map((e=>[e.client_id,kl(e.title||""),kl(e.content||""),kl(e.mood||""),kl((e.tags||[]).join(";")),new Date(e.created_at).toLocaleString()].join(",")));return e.join(",")+"\n"+n.join("\n")}if("bill"===e){const e=["client_id","type","amount","category","note","bill_date"],n=t.bills.map((e=>[e.client_id,e.type,e.amount,kl(e.category||""),kl(e.note||""),e.bill_date||""].join(",")));return e.join(",")+"\n"+n.join("\n")}if("plan"===e){const e=["client_id","title","description","priority","status","deadline"],n=t.plans.map((e=>[e.client_id,kl(e.title||""),kl(e.description||""),e.priority||2,1===e.status?"进行中":"已完成",e.deadline||""].join(",")));return e.join(",")+"\n"+n.join("\n")}return""}function kl(e){return e.includes(",")||e.includes('"')||e.includes("\n")?'"'+e.replace(/"/g,'""')+'"':e}const wl=new Set(["siji_provider_keys","siji_api_key","siji_index","siji_device_id","siji_export_json","siji_pin","siji_pin_fail","siji_pin_lock_until","siji_offline_cache","siji_offline_